Subject: [PATCH] net: dsa: qca8k: add opt-in native QinQ bring-up

Implement the measured QCA8337 edge/core programming through qca8k, with
MDIO-only management and exact source-conduit/SVID steering. Initial scope
is AX3000 native standalone and VLAN-unaware bridge traffic. VLAN-aware
bridges, customer uppers and LAG are deliberately not admitted yet.
The tagger remains separate from the established YT921x implementation.

